Z||000000||tgowens||05-14-2000||11:16 PM||||OK, I wanted a sub-woofer installed so I contacted George at the Fieroshop. George said he could install a sub in no time.....does this look right?<P>The first picture is the sub box placement (still not sure this is right but, well, George is the pro, right? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sub_installation1.JPG"> <BR>Well, I wasn't sure but George said not to worry is would sound GREAT!! This picture is after the tube placement........(I'm still doubting his experience with sub-woofers at this point...... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sub_installation2.JPG"> Well, I wanted to make sure I could hear it in the car (since EVERYONE else could hear it......once again George said "Don't worry, it'll sound GREAT!!" Here is a photo of the final installation........ <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sub_installation.JPG"> <P>So, I pull out of the Fieroshop, crank up the sound and promptly get pulled over by Hayward's finest -- I broke <I>what</I> noise abatement law?? Disturbing the peace? reading me my rights? Geeeezzzz, GEORGE, HELLLLLP!!!||||reg||1
