Z||000005||Robert||05-15-2000||12:05 AM||||Hey George, Terry’s sub system looks exactly like the one you installed on my car. <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sub-car.jpg"> <P> You told me I would be the only Fiero in town with your super duper high output sub system.<BR>That’s it, off is comes.<P>Robert<P>||||reg||8
